**/ios/Pods/
**/macos/Pods/
**/ios/.symlinks/
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.framework
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.podspec
**/ios/Flutter/App.framework
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/**/.dart_tool
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies

